    Most small businesses discover their vulnerabilities during an incident — not before.
    The Operational Resilience Index gives you a clear picture before that happens.
  </p>

  <div class="lp-ori-callout">
    <div>
      <h3>Operational Resilience Index (ORI)</h3>
